    "text": "Summary",
    "style": "Heading 1",
    "level": 1,
    "marker": null,
    "list_level": null
   },
   {
    "text": "We reviewed accounts payable controls for the twelve months to June 30, 2026. Controls were generally effective, but we found three weaknesses that need action this quarter.",
    "style": "Normal",
    "level": null,
    "marker": null,
    "list_level": null
   },
   {
    "text": "Findings",
    "style": "Heading 1",
    "level": 1,
    "marker": null,
    "list_level": null
   },
   {
    "text": "Duplicate vendor records: 212 of 4,180 active vendors appear more than once.",
    "style": "List Paragraph",
    "level": null,
    "marker": "",
    "list_level": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "Approval limits are not enforced in the invoice workflow.",
    "style": "List Paragraph",
    "level": null,
    "marker": "",
    "list_level": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "Payment runs lack a second reviewer at two sites:",
    "style": "List Paragraph",
    "level": null,
    "marker": "",
    "list_level": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "Dundee, since the departure of the deputy controller",
    "style": "List Paragraph",
    "level": null,
    "marker": "o",
    "list_level": 2
   },
   {
    "text": "Swansea, where no second reviewer was ever appointed",
    "style": "List Paragraph",
    "level": null,
    "marker": "o",
    "list_level": 2
   },
   {
    "text": "Exceptions by Quarter",
    "style": "Heading 1",
    "level": 1,
    "marker": null,
    "list_level": null
   },
   {
